---
import PageLayout from '../../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
import LegalIdentity from '../../components/LegalIdentity.astro';
import { AUTHOR_NAME, CONTACT_EMAIL, LAST_UPDATED, LEGAL, SITE_NAMES, SITE_URL } from '../../data/site-config';
import { route } from '../../i18n/routes';
import { P } from '../../lib/engine/params';
const lang = 'en';
---
<PageLayout title={`Cookies – ${SITE_NAMES[lang]}`} description="Elpriskollen sets no cookies and stores nothing on your device. The all-in electricity price, grid fee and appliance costs are worked out in your browser." lang={lang} noindex={true} breadcrumbs={[{ label: 'Cookies' }]} showAuthor={false}>
  <div class="prose prose-slate max-w-none">
    <h1>Cookies</h1>
    <p>The site sets no cookies and does not use your browser’s local storage. The price calculator, the grid-fee comparison and the appliance calculators need nothing saved: everything is recomputed when you change a value.</p>
    <h2>No tracking, no advertising</h2><p>There are no ads, no social buttons and no trackers, hence no cookie banner. Should we one day add an anonymous, cookie-free check that pages work, it will be described here before it goes live.</p>
    <h2>Embedded calculator</h2><p>The calculator embedded on other sites sets no cookies either. More in the <a href={route('privacy', lang)}>privacy policy</a>.</p>
    <p>Questions: <a href={`mailto:${CONTACT_EMAIL}`}>{CONTACT_EMAIL}</a>. Updated {LAST_UPDATED}.</p>
  </div>
</PageLayout>
